# Final Profit Shield storage guard.
# IMPORTANT: existing/legacy media must never suddenly lock the owner or existing users out.
# By default we protect the actual disk headroom instead of treating months of legacy media
# as newly consumed allowance. Set SIMO_MEDIA_HARD_CAP_MB > 0 later only if you deliberately
